 154:Core/Src/can.c **** /// CAN Command Packet Structure ///
 155:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 16 bit position command, between -4*pi and 4*pi
 156:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit velocity command, between -30 and + 30 rad/s
 157:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit kp, between 0 and 500 N-m/rad
 158:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 12 bit kd, between 0 and 100 N-m*s/rad
