 160:Core/Src/can.c **** /// CAN Packet is 8 8-bit words
 161:Core/Src/can.c **** /// Formatted as follows.  For each quantity, bit 0 is LSB
 162:Core/Src/can.c **** /// 0: [position[15-8]]
